---
import FloralImage from "./FloralImage.astro";
const links = {
  youtube: "", // full watch URL, embed derived below
  instagram: "",
  tiktok: "",
};

const youtubeEmbed = links.youtube
  ? links.youtube.replace("watch?v=", "embed/")
  : null;
---

<section class="bg-botanical relative overflow-hidden bg-cream-100 px-6 py-16 text-center">
  <FloralImage class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-4 -right-6 h-36 w-auto -scale-x-100 opacity-85 sm:h-48" />
  <FloralImage class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-4 -left-6 h-36 w-auto rotate-180 opacity-85 sm:h-48" />

  <h2 class="font-display text-4xl text-dusty-900" data-reveal>Live Streaming</h2>
  <div class="mx-auto mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2" data-reveal>
    <span class="h-px w-14 bg-terracotta-500/40"></span>
    <FloralImage class="h-10 w-auto opacity-90" />
    <span class="h-px w-14 bg-terracotta-500/40"></span>
  </div>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-sm text-dusty-700" data-reveal>
    Buat yang belum bisa hadir langsung, ikuti acara lewat live streaming di bawah ini.
  </p>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
    {youtubeEmbed ? (
      <div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
        <iframe
          class="h-full w-full"
          src={youtubeEmbed}
          title="Live Streaming Akad & Resepsi"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    ) : (
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-dashed border-dusty-300 p-10 text-sm text-dusty-700">
        Link YouTube live belum diisi, isi <code>links.youtube</code> di komponen ini H-1.
      </div>
    )}

    <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-dusty-700">
      Instagram Live dan TikTok Live tidak bisa di-embed langsung di halaman ini (limitasi platform),
      tonton via tombol berikut saat acara berlangsung:
    </p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a
        href={links.instagram || "#"}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="rounded-full bg-terracotta-500 px-5 py-2 text-xs tracking-widest text-cream-50 uppercase hover:bg-terracotta-700"
      >
        Tonton di Instagram
      </a>
      <a
        href={links.tiktok || "#"}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="rounded-full bg-dusty-700 px-5 py-2 text-xs tracking-widest text-cream-50 uppercase hover:bg-dusty-900"
      >
        Tonton di TikTok
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
